--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadPanelPhrases_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd42a76fe5ff24841b1bc5504fd47e17, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 903105527808
    m_Localized: I arrange the pieces...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4699302969344
    m_Localized: Blowing away the dust...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8516488708096
    m_Localized: I'm ordering cement for the field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8808546484224
    m_Localized: I'm sorting tic-tac-toe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8883817463808
    m_Localized: The figures on the green field touch the grass, try it yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8969700032512
    m_Localized: I draw cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9089610989568
    m_Localized: I draw crosses on the calendar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9182296719360
    m_Localized: If you find a bug, let me know, I will write a report and this timeline
      will be destroyed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9503290998784
    m_Localized: "To win, you need to collect a line from a certain number of pieces
      on the board. \nI'll give you a board, and maybe some pieces, too. I won't
      give you a combination."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9737916170240
    m_Localized: The cards spend mana, I won't give it to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9856954712064
    m_Localized: I'm laying out the field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9929159655424
    m_Localized: Coloring the shapes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10043643183104
    m_Localized: I can add something clever, for example...... Okay, that's fine.
      I'll try it in the next timeline.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10224132472832
    m_Localized: I draw unicorns...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11045142315008
    m_Localized: "\u041E\u0431\u0443\u0447\u0430\u044E \u0444\u0438\u0433\u0443\u0440\u044B
      \u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044C "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11891376701440
    m_Localized: I'm putting the sticks under the servers. They won't fall..?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12021760835584
    m_Localized: What if the stones are soft, just harden when touched?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12655474032640
    m_Localized: Doing the job
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14600037253120
    m_Localized: I leave jokes in other version lines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14918389121024
    m_Localized: I buy crutches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15049826025472
    m_Localized: "Why did we add \u2018not\u2019 to chess and not use any of them?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15122744000512
    m_Localized: But in the old version lines.. Eh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15329229586432
    m_Localized: Do you know about the important rule of the game? Write to me as
      soon as you think of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15434359816192
    m_Localized: We are, aren't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15525845975040
    m_Localized: Jumping under textures is prohibited. Correction of line errors
      at your expense :)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15782881312768
    m_Localized: It happens to me that I say forbidden words. If you're vulnerable...
      Well, let's not be sad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16284905947136
    m_Localized: If the universe is endless, then there is a cat in it who can create
      a game with random keystrokes, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16363402346496
    m_Localized: To aim, press pcm... oh, the wrong attractor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16675299180544
    m_Localized: "- I made a game! \n-I'm not.\n- Who are you!?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16970200694784
    m_Localized: What are you doing on my disk?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17119748603904
    m_Localized: The game will be delayed, I'm drinking tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17201810161664
    m_Localized: "\u2013 So, who are you? \n-Is it that important?\n\u2013 If you
      have oatmeal cookies for my tea, then no"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17457364910080
    m_Localized: -I think we'll get along.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17578232168448
    m_Localized: Shuffling the deck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17958068338688
    m_Localized: Um... what does this red button mean?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18040746459136
    m_Localized: The host is fighting for food, expect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19562683219968
    m_Localized: Loading...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19643977220096
    m_Localized: Loading resources...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19808523960320
    m_Localized: I connect with the higher mind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19885804011520
    m_Localized: Beeeep beep!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19945778364416
    m_Localized: I'm making my move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20019270959104
    m_Localized: Thinking about something important. What if we take an existing
      name and add \"Not\" to it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20356178427904
    m_Localized: 'I can...I wish you good luck.

      Yes, I will do that. Good
      luck.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20667945238528
    m_Localized: But it was better in the previous version... Or not? What has changed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20758298935296
    m_Localized: Has something changed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20847222374400
    m_Localized: I exist? But how?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20913756618752
    m_Localized: Again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20927262277632
    m_Localized: Again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10173843563429888
    m_Localized: 'Nothing is impossible for someone who tries.


      <i>Alexander
      the Great</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10174475972198400
    m_Localized: 'Don''t neglect your enemies: They''re the first to notice your
      mistakes.


      <i>Antisphere</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10174903053008896
    m_Localized: Night is followed by day, and hunger is followed by abundance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10175174030213120
    m_Localized: 'Defeat is not as dangerous as the fear of admitting defeat.


      <i>Vladimir
      Ilyich Lenin</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10175425420017664
    m_Localized: '<b>I came, I saw, I won</b>.


      <i>Gaius Julius Caesar</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10175769864650752
    m_Localized: 'Divide and conquer


      <i>Gaius Julius Caesar</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10175907899195392
    m_Localized: '<b>Experience is a teacher of everything</b>


      <i>Gaius Julius
      Caesar</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10176361743859712
    m_Localized: 'No task will seem impossible if you break it down into small parts.


      <i>Henry
      Ford</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10176683266621440
    m_Localized: 'Our failures are more instructive than our successes


      <i>Henry
      Ford</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10176958966611968
    m_Localized: '<b>There''s only one way out of the coffin, so don''t whine.</b>


      <i>Johnny
      Depp</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
